        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nskinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF\nskinparam dpi 160\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName \&quot;DejaVu Sans\&quot;\nskinparam defaultFontSize 13\nskinparam ArrowColor #37474F\nskinparam actor {\n  BackgroundColor #ECEFF1\n  BorderColor #37474F\n}\nskinparam usecase {\n  BackgroundColor #E8F0FE\n  BorderColor #3F5B8B\n  FontColor #1A237E\n}\nskinparam rectangle {\n  BorderColor #37474F\n  BackgroundColor #FCFCFC\n}\n\nleft to right direction\n\nactor \&quot;Organizador de Torneo\\n(ROL-02)\&quot; as ORG\nactor \&quot;Árbitro\\n(ROL-05)\&quot; as ARB\nactor \&quot;Administrador General\\n(ROL-01)\&quot; as ADM\n\nADM --|&gt; ORG\n\nrectangle \&quot;SGDM — Núcleo de competencia y resultados\&quot; {\n\n  usecase \&quot;CU-14\\nGenerar calendario\\ndel torneo\&quot; as U14\n  usecase \&quot;CU-14.1\\nGenerar fixture de Liga\\n(todos contra todos)\&quot; as U141\n  usecase \&quot;CU-14.2\\nGenerar llaves de\\nEliminación Directa\&quot; as U142\n  usecase \&quot;CU-14.3\\nGenerar emparejamiento\\nSistema Suizo\&quot; as U143\n  usecase \&quot;CU-27\\nAplicar seeding de\\ncabezas de serie\&quot; as U27\n  usecase \&quot;CU-28\\nVerificar historial de\\nenfrentamientos previos\&quot; as U28\n\n  usecase \&quot;CU-18\\nRegistrar resultado de\\nenfrentamiento\&quot; as U18\n  usecase \&quot;CU-29\\nRegistrar Walkover (WO)\&quot; as U29\n  usecase \&quot;CU-20\\nRecalcular tabla\\nde posiciones\&quot; as U20\n  usecase \&quot;CU-30\\nAplicar criterios\\nde desempate\&quot; as U30\n\n  usecase \&quot;CU-16\\nCerrar ronda\&quot; as U16\n  usecase \&quot;CU-23\\nReabrir fase o\\nronda cerrada\&quot; as U23\n  usecase \&quot;CU-24\\nRegistrar en log\\nde auditoría\&quot; as U24\n}\n\nORG --&gt; U14\nORG --&gt; U18\nORG --&gt; U16\nARB --&gt; U18\nADM --&gt; U23\n\nU141 --|&gt; U14\nU142 --|&gt; U14\nU143 --|&gt; U14\n\nU143 ..&gt; U28 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nU27 .&gt; U142 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\n\nU18 ..&gt; U20 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nU20 ..&gt; U30 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nU29 .&gt; U18 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\n\nU16 ..&gt; U20 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nU23 ..&gt; U24 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nU16 ..&gt; U24 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\nnote bottom of U30\n  RF-09: orden estricto y excluyente\n  1) puntos  2) diferencia de goles\n  3) enfrentamiento directo\n  4) goles a favor  5) sorteo\nend note\n\nnote bottom of U28\n  RF-10: excluye toda combinación\n  de rivales ya enfrentados en\n  rondas previas\nend note\n\nnote right of U29\n  RF-12: aplica el marcador\n  configurado y persiste el\n  estado \&quot;WO\&quot;\nend note\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="rOIvD6cN2JFm6FQDV5Oj-1">
